meta {
  name: Policies
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  Read endpoints of PolicyController: which roles an app policy grants
  access to, and a structured view of the rules in one or more app policies.

  Both endpoints are [AllowAnonymous] in the application, so no bearer token
  is needed. APIM still requires the Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key header;
  without it APIM answers 401 before the request reaches the application.

  The fixture is the stored policy for ttd/authz-bruno-testapp1, which exists
  in AT22 and TT02 (testdata/policies/<env>.js). The suite is read only and
  needs no cleanup.
}
